# Raw scrape cache (scripts/scrape-brands.py) — a re-run convenience so the
# scraper doesn't re-hit the live sites, not needed to run the seed itself
# (which only reads the small normalised scripts/scraped/*-catalog.json
# files, tracked below). The Outfitters raw feed alone is ~15MB, too large
# to be worth committing.
scripts/scraped/*/


# Run artifact from scripts/wallet-qa-gate.js — regenerated on every run.
wallet-qa-results.json

# Team credential sheet — consolidated demo logins incl. super admin.
# This repo is PUBLIC; never commit this file.
TEAM_CREDENTIALS.md

# Run artifact from scripts/shopping-triage-probe.js
shopping-triage-results.json

shopping-integrity-results.json
